00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:29.380
Reach for the words, reach for the story, follow the rainbow sun to a shining tide.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:49.480
You young people, how youthful you are in your youngness.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.150
Are you feeling all right?

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.310
